      "text": "Do not gate a walk-up floor. A tenant gate blocks anonymous phone joins, so the QR experience\nstops working for anyone outside your tenant. Gate it only for internal-only audiences.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Do not gate a walk-up floor. A tenant gate blocks anonymous phone joins, so the QR experience\nstops working for anyone outside your tenant. Gate it only for internal-only audiences.",
